okとpermissions断片の端末settingsへの冪等マージ、`lattice hooks status`による検証を契約候補とする。\n- Spotter併載時の二重提案は許容し、住み分け設計を行わない。\n- 正典契約は`docs/01_integration-package.md`へ置く。\n\n## Scope\n\n本ToDoの着手時に専用campaign planを起票し、その起票をもってbacklog側を完了する。dotagents側のonboardingとverify-install追従はdotagents側waveが所有し、本campaignの範囲外と明記する。\n\n## 受入条件\n\n専用planがLattice storeへ正規authoringされ、install/status契約、Claude/Codex host、冪等merge、permissions、非目標、検証工程がtask graphとして保持される。","lane":"campaign-entry","narrative_anchor":null,"narrative_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L84","parent_task_id":null,"task_id":"bk-006","title":"sensor気づかせ導線のinstall契約を専用campaignとして起票する"}],"topology_digest":"04e48c53d3185df627ab9ab8e5af54a2b4aea77622628313336e11415316bb44"},"plan_key":"backlog","predecessor":{"journal_head_digest":"1db04a3126f6130d6e086ffe21f6e5dce7f71090b53c606cb8d8e23cc7ff519c","plan_digest":"016068471e06fc9d95953d705a19ddc315e686e156ce28b75cb1f0acc62a15ed","plan_version":"rev-c336ebf0aba155005016c538"},"project_id":"lattice","reconciliation":{"predecessor_reconciliation_digest":"ec1fdedc46fd5c074d78ef2e94df5954f84a0bb60f91b45ed77008a854e00341","reconciliation_digest":"9a0a68b54d51ba3669f4d699e74804338d57b4efd7098722ab55a18e9abb24b2","source_inventory_digest":"5f9e28e4d8624596e99152368c616921851e7265784a02e096710947b272c4ff"},"revision_digest":"9093832e1045b277d93cd875b33dae4051792e22b722317c4f02e62ad3605601","schema":"lattice.todo_revision.v1","source_inventory":{"active":[{"source_digest":"5dd794501014d1218d6416aa25620a13c48a756b84d04c0ae9e06e78df1d5d3a","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L79","task_id":"bk-001"},{"source_digest":"11945b3b69a19460421863e49bacf266350f76ecc99079f555d2fa0d3b70b689","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L80","task_id":"bk-002"},{"source_digest":"6447d53b047ab2b253917739589d03df2518f4c106af282b66d115a6127398ea","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L81","task_id":"bk-003"},{"source_digest":"d523311903812274531df32e9b31b155c70668ddee3b2c264105ebe2e23a3457","source_ref":"docs/plan_backlog.md#L82","task_id